In this Part, (a) “existing proceeding” means a court proceeding commenced but not concluded under the former rules;
(b) “former rules” means the ([Alta. Reg.] 390/68) Alberta Rules of Court in effect immediately before these rules come into force.

*[Alta. Reg. 124/2010, r. 15.1 effective November 1, 2010 (Alta. Gaz. August 14, 2010)]*
